# UX skills (Pix-Puzzle)

Before non-trivial UI/UX work, read the matching skill under `.agents/skills/` (also linked from `.cursor/skills/`):

| Concern | Skill |
|---------|--------|
| Mobile layout, a11y, flows | `mobile-ui-ux-designer` |
| Palette, type, visual system | `ui-ux-pro-max` |
| Game HUD, feedback, menus | `game-ui-ux` |

Follow `design-system/pix-puzzle/MASTER.md` (paper + ink). Do not reintroduce neon/dark arcade chrome unless the user asks.

Search helper:

```bash
python3 .agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<query>" --domain ux
```
